<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>MountainBike-Str-Con-Dex</Major>
    <Description>This will level up your Strenght, Constitution and Dexterity


1. Get your character heavy. (put logs, rocks or gravel bags)
2. Eat and drink (Foods with lots of Protein help too)
3. Get your MountainBike and find a field that its generally straight.
4. Run the macro. Your character will cycle in circles for 60 min. 
(Note that your character will get hungry before the 60min!)
Tip: Keep your food between 50% to 20% for passive Dex points.

Enjoy</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 26 1
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 60 min
KeyUp 4 1
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 64</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Scum</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>